<title>BELGIUM: EU bases feed refunds on cost of raw inputs.</title>
<headline>EU bases feed refunds on cost of raw inputs.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has based export refunds for cereal-based compound feed on the cost of raw inputs, said an announcement in the European Union's Official Journal of Friday.</p>
<p>The notice in the journal, received on Monday, said the system allowed more account to be taken of commercial conditions.</p>
<p>The rates fixed, with effect from Friday, were given as:</p>
<p>maize and maize products 22.00 Ecus/tonne</p>
<p>cereal products 10.04 Ecus/tonne</p>
